Z||000000||turbo86se||09-25-2000||08:38 PM||||<BR>hey everyone, as a door prize for attending Curry's Southeast VA Fiero show in Williamsburg, VA last June, I won a pretty cool poster, direct from FOCOA! It's got nice hand-drawn pictures of all the Fiero models, Fiero interior, choices of steering wheels, and wheels/covers. All the specs are there too. The only thing that isn't right, is they excluded the 87 for the 86SE and 85GT body style, and didn't include 86 for the 88 and 87GT body style. Oh well, still pretty cool. Now if I can get these stiches out of my hand I could frame it and put it up in my garage with all my other Fiero pictures, posters, and of course, my turbo-charged, black 86SE sleeping out all this rain under a cover.<P>Phil did you get one of these posters? <P>As a reminder to everyone, next year's Williamsburg, VA show will be the FOCOA nationals, like the show in Louisville. Turnout should be more than 300 Fieros. It's at the Ramada again, I don't know where they're going to put all the Fieros!! I think it's the first weekend in August. Make plans to attend. I won't get third place this time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Time to get ready for the COLTS game!! Where's my beer?||||reg||6
